message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PaRMMoSaHN: Pangenome Reference-based Metabolic Modelling by Saving Homolog Networks"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-03-09
authors:
  - family-names: "De Win"
    given-names: "Robbe"
    email: "robbedewin@hotmail.com"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-7003-5219"
  - family-names: "De Vrieze"
    given-names: "Lucas"
    email: "lucas.devrieze@kuleuven.be"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6221-9348"
repository-code: "https://github.com/robbedewin/PaRMMoSaHN"
url: "https://github.com/robbedewin/PaRMMoSaHN"
abstract: "PaRMMoSaHN is a Python library for pangenome-based reconstruction of strain-specific metabolic models from bacterial genomes. It enables researchers to construct accurate metabolic models by leveraging pangenome information to capture strain-level diversity and generate homologous network representations."
keywords:
  - pangenome
  - metabolic modeling
  - systems biology
  - strain-specific models
  - bioinformatics
